! Registers ONLY 4 minimal rules on a fresh Layer 0 frontend -> fe_boot1:      !
!   1. ^Expr       (Prefix: Prototype literal)                                 !
!   2. .a / p.a    (Atom SelfField + Postfix Field chain)                      !
!   3. $p          (Prefix: Deref)                                             !
!   4. x := expr   (Infix: Basic immutable bind)                               !
!                                                                              !
! Then reads, parses (with fe_boot1), and evaluates lib/std/layer1.lang.       !
! ============================================================================ !

